Modifications
-------------

Stacked panes (pane stacking, LayoutNode::Stack, `pane split --stacked`, and
the stack navigation and mouse handling that go with it) were written by
Cory Grinstead (universalmind303) in commit eeffd72, carried here unmodified.
Original authorship is preserved in this repository's git history.

Added on top of that work:

  * config: allow binding stack_pane, unstack_pane, and break_pane, so the
    stacked-pane actions are reachable from config.toml keybindings rather
    than by mouse only. (src/config/model.rs)

No files from the upstream project have been removed or relicensed.
